cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this resource, please cite it."
title: "Generate, then verify: pairing a molecular generative model with the checks that can fail it"
abstract: >-
  An eight-module teaching resource for molecular design that pairs a generative
  model with a verification check that can fail it, from toy diffusion and
  flow-matching samplers through pocket-conditioned ligand generation with
  PoseBusters and PoseCheck, a co-folding verifier, and a transfer of the same
  loop to protein design. Runs on a laptop CPU with no GPU, API key, or download.
type: software
authors:
